Z||000000||Monkeyman||08-01-2000||03:20 PM||||I just received the front brake conversion kit from the Fiero Store and will probably be buying the parts for the rear next week.  Randy Agee said that he used a MC from a full size Blazer.  The Fiero Store has a "Big Bore" MC.  Does anyone know if this is the same as the Blazer unit?  Would there be an advantage to either?<P>This is the MC from the Fiero Store.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bigboreMC.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||5
Z||000001||Oreif||08-02-2000||02:03 AM||||The Fiero Store Is a Fiero MC bored 3mm over stock. The full size blazer is 5mm bigger than a stock Fiero. 3mm is better 5mm is best. The Blazer MC is $34.00 at NAPA and if you wait a week then retun the core they won't check it.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||08-02-2000||02:08 AM||||Looks like I'll have to make a trip to the local auto parts store.  Thanx.||||reg||1
Z||000003||BBBAD GT||08-02-2000||09:31 AM||||I had to get the Blazer MC after my swap, not a big job, and no problems so far.  Just don't forget to swap the tank.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||08-02-2000||10:02 AM||||How do you change the reservoir?  Do you just pop the old one off and pop the new one on?  Does it make a huge difference?  What exactly is the difference?  Less pedal travel?  Stiffer pedal?  What?||||reg||1
Z||000005||BBBAD GT||08-02-2000||05:41 PM||||The one that comes with the Blazer MC is too tall, you won't be able to close the hood.  The Fiero one is shorter.  Other than that, there is no difference.  Just like you sid, pop the old one off, and put it on the new one.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
